## ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
## nexus | ItacaChamber.bb0nu.config.mac
##
## Template. The job script replaces @SEED@, @START_ID@ and @OUTPUT@.
## Neutrinoless double beta decays of Xe-136 to the ground state, uniform in the gas.
## Events are saved when the energy deposited in the gas lies in the window below.
## Written by scripts/iitaca/write_iitaca_macros.jl from the cards of config/iitaca
## (variant II_L1000_D500). Do not edit: change the cards and write it again.
## ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

/run/verbose 1
/event/verbose 0
/tracking/verbose 0
/process/em/verbose 0

/control/execute macros/iitaca/II_L1000_D500/ItacaChamber.mac

/Generator/Decay0Interface/inputFile none
/Generator/Decay0Interface/Xe136DecayMode 1
/Generator/Decay0Interface/Ba136FinalState 0
/Generator/Decay0Interface/region GAS

/Actions/DefaultEventAction/min_energy 2300. keV
/Actions/DefaultEventAction/max_energy 2470. keV

/nexus/random_seed @SEED@
/nexus/persistency/start_id @START_ID@
/nexus/persistency/output_file @OUTPUT@
/nexus/persistency/event_type signal
